  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố &quot;chọn được bạn quê Bình Dương&quot;.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>N</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố &quot;chọn được bạn nữ&quot;.<br>\n\t\tGọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là biến cố &quot;chọn được bạn nam&quot;.<br>\t\t\n\t\tTa có<br>\t\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>25</mn><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>25</mn><mn>41</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, \t\t\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>16</mn><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>16</mn><mn>41</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, \t\t\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>%</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, \t\t\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>